OL,3,GNEWSATribute to great-grandad who died
OL,4,Aafter car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA great-grandad who died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car has been described as
OL,8,F"generous and caring" in a family
OL,9,Ftribute.
OL,11,FPeter Kegg, 84, was on Belle Vue Road
OL,12,Fin the Southbourne area of Bournemouth
OL,13,Fwhen the crash involving a silver Honda
OL,14,FJazz happened on 11 August.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital and died from
OL,17,Fhis injuries on 24 August. The BBC has
OL,18,Fasked Dorset Police for the latest on
OL,19,Fits investigation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
