OL,3,GNEWSATribute to great-grandad who died
OL,4,Aafter car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute released via the force,
OL,7,Fhis children said he would be "greatly
OL,8,Fmissed" and that he was someone "who
OL,9,Fwould help anyone and made a big impact
OL,10,Fon all those he met".
